{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/0964bb65ed36caee42e26a23d7e898a8.webp?t=1763329247\" width=687 height=17 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glowy\u2122</strong> is a minimal yet atmospheric puzzle experience where light is both your <i>only guide</i>, and your <i>greatest fear</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this journey through a mind trapped between light and darkness, you\u2019ll help a fragile being rediscover who they truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/a22a6a0f62627aa60d775aef784bcdc3.poster.avif?t=1763329247\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/a22a6a0f62627aa60d775aef784bcdc3.webm?t=1763329247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/a22a6a0f62627aa60d775aef784bcdc3.mp4?t=1763329247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/56a9b7a82d0fff6d4465f7a99402d3ac.webp?t=1763329247\" width=539 height=29 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inside a silent house that twists and reshapes with your memories, every corridor is a <i>fragment</i> of <strong>Glowy\u2019s mind</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>light</strong> from behind the door represents the outside world, <i>friends, expectations, judgment.</i> But for Glowy, that light <strong>burns</strong>. It reveals too much. It makes it impossible to <i>hide</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move deeper, you\u2019ll uncover <strong>lost pieces of yourself</strong>, waiting to be found or <i>forgotten</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/b25346670cb5dd1987279da6b4273d7b.webp?t=1763329247\" width=575 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Glowy</strong>, every level is an enigma built around the logic of light.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door you leave behind projects a beam that you can <strong>reflect, divide, or block.\u00a0</strong>Your goal is to reach the next door and power its <strong>solar panel</strong>.\u00a0Each puzzle challenges you to manipulate the beam through clever angles, combining exactness and experimentation. Misplace a mirror or let a box obstruct the ray, and you might trap yourself in <i>darkness</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/43d5fad4ecc95a5ea9ec1748a549ad7b.poster.avif?t=1763329247\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/43d5fad4ecc95a5ea9ec1748a549ad7b.webm?t=1763329247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/43d5fad4ecc95a5ea9ec1748a549ad7b.mp4?t=1763329247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first puzzles feature mirrors, prisms, boxes, and solar panels, with new mechanics and interactions coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/7459ac9aeb1518977806d8461d8f4068.avif?t=1763329247\" width=1000 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, the light will be <strong>yours</strong> <strong>to control</strong>,\u00a0and the darkness, <strong>yours to face</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the doors finally open, <i>will you reach the end</i>\u2026 or <i>lose yourself along the way</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/291db7ee7208a17251e14bfbb3bbe2ef.avif?t=1763329247\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4153450?t=1763329247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/812b98d67be0af70b743d1b587d8031a3c4e406c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763329247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/aac9f45c0d26605ad596c8627a1e123dfa5f2482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763329247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/aac9f45c0d26605ad596c8627a1e123dfa5f2482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763329247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/0964bb65ed36caee42e26a23d7e898a8.webp?t=1763329247\" width=687 heig