512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, the light will be <strong>yours</strong> <strong>to control</strong>,\u00a0and the darkness, <strong>yours to face</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the doors finally open, <i>will you reach the end</i>\u2026 or <i>lose yourself along the way</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/extras/291db7ee7208a17251e14bfbb3bbe2ef.avif?t=1763329247\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p>","developers":["Eterna Arena"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153450/862f1fccb0de86e454c73b9431450f8dbe3339e4/header.jpg?t=1763329247","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153450/945462536/1c9f5febfdbd8fb75ec3fa4bc1641edff85e32f4/1762014650/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762890842","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153450/945462536/1c9f5febfdbd8fb75ec3fa4bc1641edff85e32f4/1762014650/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762890842","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153450/945462536/1c9f5febfdbd8fb75ec3fa4bc1641edff85e32f4/1762014650/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762890842","id":257225531,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225531/movie480.mp4?t=1762890842","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225531/movie_max.mp4?t=1762890842"},"name":"Glowy - Game Jam Version Release","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225531/5ed882f634ed0e726a736953581f336b3d738f96/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762890842","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail